  title: 'UK net migration, 2012 to 2025',
  summary: 'Net migration rose sharply from 2021 and reached ' ~ (nm.data | at(2022) | number) ~ ' in 2022, the highest point on this calendar-year series. It has fallen in each of the three years since, to ' ~ (netMigration.value | number) ~ '.',
  unit: 'people per year',
